<br>
<<link [[Special Lemonade|Robin's Lemonade Piss]]>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>

<br>
<</if>>

<<elseif $rng gte 16>>
"Thanks, I'm almost out of lemons, I'd like you to watch over the stand and sell what's left while I go get more."
<br><br>
<<set $danger to random(1, 10000)>><<set $dangerevent to 0>>
<<if $danger gte (9900 - $allure) and $canpee gte 1 and $watersportsdisable is "f">>
